    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dimly lit clockwork laboratory of the infamous inventor, Lord Cogswell, a place where steam hisses through copper pipes and the relentless grinding of brass gears fills the air. The heavy, riveted steel door sealing your only exit is securely locked, governed by an intricate master relay system of the inventor's own design. To escape before the unstable boiler overloads and destroys the facility, you must navigate a web of archaic calculating engines, decipher cryptic mechanical logs, and trace precise routes through his pneumatic networks. Every strange contraption in this room is meticulously interconnected, relying on perfectly calibrated inputs from one another to function. You will need to carefully observe the devices, figure out their sequence, and unravel this steam-powered puzzle piece by piece. Time is ticking, and the pressure gauges are already creeping into the red zone. Find your way out before it's too late.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
